			"notes": "# The Biome Colors Update\n\nFinally, your biomes are colored correctly! Well, if you set it up right - see [docs](https://github.com/GuzioMG/Surwebyor/blob/47728a47fdaa3af3c4ed531433e65dcfe8261502/README.md#config) for instructions.\n\nAlso published on [Modrinth](https://modrinth.com/mod/surwebyor/version/v0.5).\n\n*Note: It's marked as „pre-release” due to several outstanding problems, all listed [here](https://github.com/GuzioMG/Surwebyor/blob/47728a47fdaa3af3c4ed531433e65dcfe8261502/README.md#warning-early-alpha-alert). However, it is USABLE to enough of an extent (the terrain is shown as it's supposed to, and critical config options needed for deployment in the real world are all available) that I feel safe showing it to the world.*"
